WEBVTT

00:06:29.870 --> 00:06:31.655
the only way that it has ever been done,

00:06:31.655 --> 00:06:33.844
by putting your head down and performing

00:06:33.844 --> 00:06:35.666
with diligence and devotion

00:06:35.666 --> 00:06:37.352
and respect and reverence

00:06:37.352 --> 00:06:39.396
whatever the task is that love

00:06:39.396 --> 00:06:41.476
is calling forth from you next.

00:06:41.476 --> 00:06:43.660
You just do that, and keep doing that

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:45.309
again and again and again,

00:06:45.309 --> 00:06:47.965
and I can absolutely promise you,
from long personal experience

00:06:47.965 --> 00:06:50.220
in every direction, I can assure you

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:52.290
that it's all going to be okay.

00:06:52.290 --> 00:06:53.981
Thank you.

00:06:53.981 --> 00:06:57.981
(Applause)